    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In Memoirium, everything is but sand and stars.<br><br><strong>DREAM, DEFY, DECORATE</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Peculiar Locations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294440/extras/59f2511f4c682eafc17e997e4a56d468.poster.avif?t=1755485881\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294440/extras/59f2511f4c682eafc17e997e4a56d468.webm?t=1755485881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294440/extras/59f2511f4c682eafc17e997e4a56d468.mp4?t=1755485881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The realm of dreams does not abide by any rules or genre. In one moment, you will find yourself in a simple 21st-century school, and in the next, your eyes will fall upon a castle held together by wax.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Masks and more</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294440/extras/7e4222226cba04e4ca36d9aaca2bbcbb.poster.avif?t=1755485881\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294440/extras/7e4222226cba04e4ca36d9aaca2bbcbb.webm?t=1755485881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294440/extras/7e4222226cba04e4ca36d9aaca2bbcbb.mp4?t=1755485881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most, if not all, of the equipment will alter your abilities and the entities you encounter. One piece of armor can affect how long negative statuses last, while a specific mask will change how enemies approach you in combat.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Consumed now but not forever.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294440/extras/dab10199d12f08b7c2f3aad2ccdf9495.poster.avif?t=1755485881\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294440/extras/dab10199d12f08b7c2f3aad2ccdf9495.webm?t=1755485881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294440/extras/dab10199d12f08b7c2f3aad2ccdf9495.mp4?t=1755485881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of the items you find will not disappear when you use them. Instead, consumables are fully replenished at certain points in your journey. Finding the same item will upgrade it, but only until a certain point.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your room</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294440/extras/22074e84304b6e2afdca2f2af4827ea8.poster.avif?t=1755485881\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294440/extras/22074e84304b6e2afdca2f2af4827ea8.webm?t=1755485881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294440/extras/22074e84304b6e2afdca2f2af4827ea8.mp4?t=1755485881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There also appears to be a mysterious location that you have control of in the dream world.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In Memoirium, everything is but sand and stars.<br><br><strong>DREAM, DEFY, DECORATE</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Peculiar Locations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294440/extras/59f2511f4c682eafc17e997e4a56d468.poster.avif?t=1755485881\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294440/extras/59f2511f4c682eafc17e997e4a56d468.webm?t=1755485881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294440/extras/59f2511f4c682eafc17e997e4a56d468.mp4?t=1755485881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The realm of dreams does not abide by any rules or genre. In one moment, you will find yourself in a simple 21st-century school, and in the next, your eyes will fall upon a castle held together by wax.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Masks and more</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294440/extras/7e4222226cba04e4ca36d9aaca2bbcbb.poster.avif?t=1755485881\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294440/extras/7e4222226cba04e4ca36d9aaca2bbcbb.webm?t=1755485881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294440/extras/7e4222226cba04e4ca36d9aaca2bbcbb.mp4?t=1755485881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most, if not all, of the equipment will alter your abilities and the entities you encounter. One piece of armor can affect how long negative statuses last, while a specific mask will change how enemies approach you in combat.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Consumed now but not forever.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294440/extras/dab10199d12f08b7c2f3aad2ccdf9495.poster.avif?t=1755485881\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294440/extras/dab10199d12f08b7c2f3aad2ccdf9495.webm?t=1755485881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294440/extras/dab10199d12f08b7c2f3aad2ccdf9495.mp4?t=1755485881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of the items you find will not disappear when you use them. Instead, consumables are fully replenished at certain points in your journey. Finding the same item will upgrade it, but only until a certain point.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your room</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294440/extras/22074e84304b6e2afdca2f2af4827ea8.poster.avif?t=1755485881\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294440/extras/22074e84304b6e2afdca2f2af4827ea8.webm?t=1755485881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294440/extras/22074e84304b6e2afdca2f2af4827ea8.mp4?t=1755485881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There also appears to be a mysterious location that you have control of in the dream world.</p>",
    "short_description": "Memoirium is a retro soulslike set in a chaotic and crumbling realm of dreams. As a Dreamer, you must adapt to the world's odd rules and defy others like you in order to escape the strange and eclectic subconscious landscape.",
